    <string name="restricted_title">Switch greyed out?</string>
    <string name="restricted_steps">Android does this for every app installed from a file. Unlock it once:\n1. Tap Allow above and try the switch once.\n2. Tap Open App info below.\n3. Tap ⋮ at the top right, then Allow restricted settings.\n4. Come back and tap Allow again.</string>
