    <string name="creator_question_body">Answer honestly. It\'s you vs you.</string>
    <string name="creator_why">Why we ask?</string>
    <string name="creator_why_body">Creators sometimes need these apps for work, like going live, posting or editing. Creator mode lets you pause StopIt for a set time while you work, then it turns back on by itself.\n\nIf you just want an easy way out, say no. Only you lose if you lie. It\'s you vs you.</string>
