    <string name="chart_saved">Time saved · last 7 days</string>
    <string name="dashboard_note">How these numbers work: time and opens come straight from Android and are exact. Android does not let apps see single reels or shorts without Accessibility access, which Google blocks for apps like this, so reels are estimated at about 20 seconds each. Time saved adds your usual visit length every time StopIt turns you back. Everything is calculated on your phone.</string>
